{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This collection consists of three distinct albums:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Bards Album</strong> \u2013 6 tracks performed by Three Bards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Themes Album</strong> \u2013 16 tracks, including the game\u2019s iconic main theme, character creation music, village, and special NPCs themes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Music Album</strong> \u2013 17 exploration and combat tracks to accompany your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Time: 2:26:09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in MP3, or 44.1khz WAV stereo format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Composers: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jakub Michalewicz </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Konrad D\u0142u\u017cniewski </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mixed and mastered by:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jakub Michalewicz </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Konrad D\u0142u\u017cniewski </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instrumentalists: </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jakub Michalewicz: Violin, Viola, Cello, Double Bass, Flute, Pan Flute, Accordion, Guitars, Drums</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Konrad D\u0142u\u017cniewski: Whistle, Drums </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diana Gliniecka: Vocals </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lyrics</strong>:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jakub Michalewicz </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Konrad D\u0142u\u017cniewski </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special thanks for lyrics support:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karolina Klimiuk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piotr Dziadosz </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jakub Marcinkowski </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special thanks for background vocals in the &quot;Raise Mugs&quot; track:</strong> <